<https://litlfred.github.io/folio/references/who-pub-tps-931.page-061.4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation> "Landau SI, ed. International dictionary of medicine and biology. New York, Wiley, 1986." <https://iris.who.int/graph/community/5bff2c18-6c2b-4658-9087-93811d2399c0> .
