<https://litlfred.github.io/folio/references/who-pub-tps-931.page-063.3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation> "Clfting factors Clotting factors are usually designated by roman numerals (¢.g. factor IX). An “a” added to the numeral indicates the activated form of the factor (e.g. factor VIIa)." <https://iris.who.int/graph/community/5bff2c18-6c2b-4658-9087-93811d2399c0> .
