<https://litlfred.github.io/folio/references/who-pub-tps-931.page-064-2.10> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation> "Miscellaneous Other recommendations published by WHO In addition to the books and articles mentioned above, WHO has published terminological recommendations on the following topics (among others): Allergens IUIS/WHO Allergen Nomenclature Subcommittee. Allergen nomen-clature. Bulletin of the World Health Organization, 1994, 72:797-806." <https://iris.who.int/graph/community/5bff2c18-6c2b-4658-9087-93811d2399c0> .
